## This Website is *A* Single Guide

This website is not just talking about {{el.docsAssemblerExtension_link}} — it is a live demonstration of it. All the text you're reading has been dynamically assembled from a structure of interconnected maps. It demonstrates that you can create and maintain an expansive documentation system with a similar ease to how a developer maintains a codebase.

This is the proof. This is what treating docs like code looks like. But the true power of this approach extends far beyond managing a website.

